{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/greedyColoring(strategy:presetColor:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The greedy colouring with some colours fixed in advance (rustworkx"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graph_greedy_color(preset_color_fn=)"},{"type":"text","text":"): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presetColor"},{"type":"text","text":" gives a vertex’s colour, or nil to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leave it to the strategy. Preset vertices keep their colours and count as coloured from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start; the others are coloured as by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedyColoring(strategy:)"},{"type":"text","text":", each taking the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colour no coloured neighbour has. The orders of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".largestFirst"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".smallestLast"},{"type":"text","text":" and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connected sequential strategies are those of the whole graph with the preset vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skipped (rustworkx’s largest first: whole-graph degrees, preset vertices left out);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DSatur counts preset colours in saturation from the start (rustworkx’s saturation);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".independentSet"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s class k starts without the neighbours of the vertices preset to k"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(rustworkx’s independent set); "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".coloredNeighbors"},{"type":"text","text":" counts preset neighbours as coloured and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes its first vertex from its heap. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"colorCount"},{"ty